# Mandatory Atlas PR routing

Read the top of `AGENTS.md` before creating or updating a PR. Every ordinary PR must explicitly use `--base dev`. Only the same repository's exact `dev` branch may target `main`, and only when Jeremy explicitly requests production promotion. Do not automatically release, merge, deploy, or retarget existing PRs. Install the repository pre-push hook with `node scripts/install-pr-target-hook.cjs`; do not bypass it. This rule governs this repository, not downstream users of exported plugins.
